title: Fewer links in his graph would be titled with a bare topic's name only because fetching was costly.
pid: fdccca76-3bc2-4fb9-9077-0e42ca4b2b18
body: |2-
  Not a claim that it would: a fast link to "love" is still a topic's
  name. See [[id:8910393c-e7f6-4f29-9d64-6cd3a26eba85][A link's words are all a reader has to decide whether to follow it]].
